---
import ArticleLayout from "../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
import InShort from '../../components/article/InShort.astro';
import ZenTip from '../../components/article/ZenTip.astro';
import ZenPicture from '../../components/article/ZenPicture.astro';

const card = 'block rounded-2xl border border-[color:var(--color-border)] p-4 no-underline transition hover:border-[color:var(--color-teal)]';
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="Compare Apple Watch Stress & HRV Apps"
  description="Explore documented features, measurement methods and limitations when comparing Cortisol+ with other stress and HRV apps."
  updated="2026-11-12"
  published="2026-09-09"
>
<InShort points={[
  'A stress score is <strong>an interpretation</strong> of your data.',
  'Compare <strong>inputs, explanations and cost</strong>, not just the number.',
  'Scores from different apps <strong>are not interchangeable</strong>.',
]} />

<h2>What job do you need an app to do?</h2>
<p><strong>A stress score is an interpretation of data.</strong> Before you trust the number, compare what goes into it, how it's explained, what access you need and what it costs.</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/compare/apple-watch-stress-apps/">Apple Watch stress apps: Cortisol+, Welltory, StressWatch, Bevel and Athlytic</a></li>
  <li><a href="/blog/welltory-vs-cortisol-plus/">Welltory vs Cortisol+</a></li>
</ul>
<p>These guides say clearly that we publish Cortisol+. They compare documentation. They are not independent clinical accuracy tests.</p>

<ZenTip image="/app-ui/zen_presenting_new.webp">
  Before you compare scores, check <strong>which way is good</strong> in each app. Higher isn't always better.
</ZenTip>

<h2>Which comparison should I read?</h2>
<p><strong>Pick by what you want to learn.</strong></p>
<div class="not-prose my-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
  <a href="/compare/apple-watch-stress-apps/" class={card}>
    <p class="font-extrabold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Understand Apple Watch stress scores</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)]">Five-app comparison ›</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-snug text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">Check inputs, explanations, subscription access and what happens when data is missing.</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/blog/welltory-vs-cortisol-plus/" class={card}>
    <p class="font-extrabold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Consider an alternative to Welltory</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)]">Welltory versus Cortisol+ ›</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-snug text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">Check data sources, features and how the score is explained.</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/cortisol/test/" class={card}>
    <p class="font-extrabold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Track actual hormone levels</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)]">Cortisol testing guide ›</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-snug text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">A wearable wellness score can't replace a hormone test.</p>
  </a>
  <a href="/resources/stress-sleep-journal/" class={card}>
    <p class="font-extrabold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Keep a record without a subscription</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] font-semibold text-[color:var(--color-teal-dark)]">Free observation journal ›</p>
    <p class="mt-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-snug text-[color:var(--color-ink-muted)]">Write down what you notice. It doesn't calculate a hormone level.</p>
  </a>
</div>

<a href="/start/" data-start-cta class="not-prose my-8 flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-[color:var(--color-ink)] p-5 text-white no-underline shadow-sm transition hover:brightness-110">
  <img src="/apple-touch-icon.png" alt="" width="48" height="48" class="h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-[13px]" />
  <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 leading-snug">
    <span class="block font-extrabold">Get your personal stress plan</span>
    <span class="block text-sm text-white/75">A one-minute check-in with Zen, then your plan in Cortisol+</span>
  </span>
  <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-extrabold text-[color:var(--color-ink)]">Start ›</span>
</a>

<h2>How do we compare products?</h2>
<p><strong>We link to official product pages and store listings, and we say that we make Cortisol+.</strong> We also keep documented features separate from hands-on testing.</p>
<p>Scores from different apps are not interchangeable. Prices, trial eligibility and supported devices can change, so check the current offer before you subscribe.</p>

<ZenPicture src="/app-ui/zen_companions.webp" caption="Every app has its own scale. That's normal." />

<p>For another way to look at the tradeoffs, see our <a href="/resources/perplexity/#apple-watch-apps">shared Perplexity app-comparison conversations</a>. We asked for these AI answers and show the prompts. They are not independent reviews.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
